k of 19,950, you are likely the Small Blind (having posted 50 chips). Investing more chips to call the Big Blind or raising with such a weak hand is a negative expected value (-EV) play. The best strategy is to fold, minimize the loss to just the small blind, and wait for a better hand to contest the pot.\n\nAnswer: -1'}
